      "quote": "when I play I feel relax.",
      "type": "grammar",
      "why": "\"relax\" 應為形容詞或過去分詞形式\"relaxed\"，且需要逗號分隔從句會更清楚。",
      "suggestion": "when I play, I feel relaxed."
    },
    {
      "quote": "Maybe next time I can play a song for you.",
      "type": "tone",
      "why": "句子友好但可以更自然地表達期待，例如加上時間或邀請語氣會更親切。",
      "suggestion": "Maybe next time I can play a song for you."
    },
    {
      "quote": "How are you?",
      "type": "cohesion",
      "why": "問候句很好，但後面未接附加句或問題使過渡更自然，例如詢問朋友近況以延續對話。",
      "suggestion": "How are you? How have you been lately?"
    }
